{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"891803f5f7adc05c","type":"group","label":"VPTS綁架行動：委託人是誰？","x":1104,"y":104,"width":1088,"height":1464},
		{"id":"15b656be28fbb5d6","type":"group","label":"事件","x":3978,"y":70,"width":1558,"height":1086},
		{"id":"9590a700eb3a40e9","type":"group","label":"第三次綁架行動","x":5066,"y":140,"width":446,"height":544},
		{"id":"b503d9bb1f55ecce","type":"group","label":"暗殺委託人是誰？","x":8,"y":104,"width":1088,"height":1804},
		{"id":"83a056d93f512c5f","type":"group","label":"第三方人員是誰？","x":5544,"y":46,"width":1226,"height":1510},
		{"id":"6eca50fefd90742f","type":"group","label":"未爆彈：是故意的嗎？","x":5682,"y":116,"width":308,"height":1416},
		{"id":"a19268416bb74cc2","type":"group","label":"第二張門票：V如何安排？","x":2582,"y":140,"width":698,"height":580},
		{"id":"54446d7342cadeac","type":"group","label":"護照：兩人的國籍？","x":6852,"y":92,"width":698,"height":994},
		{"id":"896b8047aa1ecba7","type":"text","text":"**張睿遇害**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-張睿案]]","x":3694,"y":136,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"f1a17e7d67d2be5a","type":"text","text":"**領取時限**\n\n4月6日0時0分後至4月7日0時0分前領取，見 [[線索-DSL-陸地現場-音樂會與孤兒院]]","x":3304,"y":112,"width":260,"height":172,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"2290b1074b1e8ea8","type":"text","text":"**印度洋王國廢墟**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-沙羅與海都事件]]","x":2298,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"fa181d038705bddb","type":"text","text":"**V有途徑獲得人魚機密**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-米迦勒與V]]","x":2216,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"bf0a6a3b472b95a4","type":"text","text":"**前軍方高層投資**\n\n董事長黑克勒認識的一名前軍方高層投資了遠古生物及文明研究所","x":1128,"y":985,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#2563EB"},
		{"id":"1e35b33df1723f35","type":"text","text":"**法國電郵**\n\n以電郵聯繫，但其電腦只用作與單一對象聯繫，位址在法國","x":1672,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},
		{"id":"decd129d045d377d","type":"text","text":"**VPTS掌握行蹤**\n\nVPTS掌握所有人魚公主的行蹤，並據此策劃連串行動","x":1908,"y":136,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"524c4cb159a0d679","type":"text","text":"**經中介委託**\n\n委託人由中介組織僱用，情報由其他人提供\n\n`採信`","x":1518,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"67b19978589a2207","type":"text","text":"**秘密交易**\n\n實際上是秘密交易，委託只是形式\n\n`採信`","x":1360,"y":1421,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"132e3a4ba31ee3f1","type":"text","text":"**只有V知路線**\n\n只有V知道人魚公主必然會經印度回國","x":1908,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"f617631cc2d4bcd3","type":"text","text":"V是真正的委託人\n\n`排除`","x":1908,"y":1457,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#CBD5E1"},
		{"id":"aec7c10f0faf59ab","type":"text","text":"**核查諾愛爾**\n\n清道夫開始核查諾愛爾背景","x":4392,"y":584,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"9fccf7bd18919ec0","type":"text","text":"**誤導終端機**\n\n清道夫試圖誤導終端機文件尚未交出","x":4002,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"833624427d2e19ea","type":"text","text":"**洗機換聯繫**\n\n發現之前收到的是假報告後馬上洗機並更換聯繫方式，無法繼續追查","x":4002,"y":985,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"06ea8665b0f7151c","type":"text","text":"積極調查SWI","x":4782,"y":608,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"1c01e114696f5594","type":"text","text":"**派遣O-117**\n\n派遣O-117前往和歌山","x":4782,"y":1009,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"413dccc1213026b6","type":"text","text":"VPTS發現屍體失蹤","x":5090,"y":172,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"d7201a6a018cad6d","type":"text","text":"事後調查被列為機密","x":5172,"y":608,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"20bec1996edc7776","type":"text","text":"**經中介接洽TI**\n\n經中介找人與TI接洽","x":32,"y":148,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"0e73ba2f36117564","type":"text","text":"**續委託至TI全滅**\n\nTI失敗後仍繼續委託，直到TI全滅","x":422,"y":136,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"c8d76c9ad0729395","type":"text","text":"**有財力僱更好傭兵**\n\n有財力聘用更好的傭兵達成目標","x":812,"y":148,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"ba1ab6bc56e3166b","type":"text","text":"**行事謹慎**\n\n行事謹慎，熟知地下商業的運作","x":32,"y":584,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"d5ddad240c906c44","type":"text","text":"**知TI能力不足**\n\n能夠判斷TI能力不足以完成委託","x":32,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"83aa0d80f36cd77b","type":"text","text":"VPTS失敗的保險","x":32,"y":1457,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"1bf144c4b66bfe74","type":"text","text":"**情報方式相同**\n\n非情報來源，情報提供方式與VPTS的委託人相同","x":812,"y":1421,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"863c25db391b7a26","type":"text","text":"專業情報人員","x":812,"y":1833,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"b4725edd6f6a17ce","type":"text","text":"**借TI消耗VPTS**\n\n委託人想借TI消耗VPTS的力量","x":617,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"382d4f4ecddc336b","type":"text","text":"**防護與隱匿**\n\n全套防護裝備、隱匿術式","x":6291,"y":148,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#2563EB"},
		{"id":"3a6be4ba9b970118","type":"text","text":"**預期交鋒**\n\n預期會與其他人交鋒","x":6096,"y":584,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"d9a6f4c88dbeebe5","type":"text","text":"**TI游離者**\n\n隸屬TI，公司核心成員是游離者\n\n`採信`","x":6486,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"f0d842860afe051d","type":"text","text":"**選擇正面交鋒**\n\n明明可以在對手行動前直接在遠處狙殺，卻選擇正面交鋒","x":6096,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"3d0dc9175c1dc71c","type":"text","text":"**故意測試SWI**\n\n故意使用未爆彈測試SWI","x":5706,"y":148,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"1826417e202d5f23","type":"text","text":"**不知是未爆彈**\n\n不知道是未爆彈，意圖殺害人魚公主","x":5706,"y":997,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"f310345b8a206fce","type":"text","text":"策劃者欠缺判斷能力","x":5706,"y":1457,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"3aa14b4f41a8b341","type":"text","text":"客戶要求","x":5706,"y":608,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"f90b513e26d702be","type":"text","text":"準點傳送至保險箱","x":2606,"y":172,"width":260,"height":52,"color":"#EA580C"},
		{"id":"9dd031ac33c1ced9","type":"text","text":"**經印度開櫃**\n\n必須經印度才能在時限內打開保險櫃","x":2996,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"823c09a7e69d4ed0","type":"text","text":"**V確認印度座標**\n\nV事前曾親自或派人到印度確認座標","x":2606,"y":572,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"4089d74eb2f659fe","type":"text","text":"**國籍不同**\n\n諾愛爾與可伶為法國籍，可可卻是日本籍","x":6876,"y":136,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},
		{"id":"b97199a76dc40ddb","type":"text","text":"**領護照即赴加**\n\n根據簽發日期與入境紀錄，諾愛爾在拿到護照後便馬上前往加拿大","x":7266,"y":124,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#2563EB"},
		{"id":"5849d0464e379b71","type":"text","text":"**原有法國籍**\n\n兩人本來就擁有法國國籍","x":6876,"y":584,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"},
		{"id":"56e69198fc89658f","type":"text","text":"**需工作簽證**\n\n兩人需辦理工作簽證","x":7266,"y":584,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#7C3AED"}
	],
